      "@type": "tg:Evidence",
      "type": "Evidence",
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Fear of Public Consequences",
      "description": "People who consider taking public action may hold back when social consequences feel personally threatening. Negative messaging and rapid public amplification can turn participation into a risk of shame, attack, or reputational harm.\n",
