      "tier": 3,
      "title": "Civic Capacity Erosion",
      "description": "Individuals trying to understand and participate in public life face declining capacity to process complex information, verify what is credible, and make time for engagement. As cognitive and practical demands increase, people become less confident in their understanding and less likely to participate.",
