      "tier": 2,
      "title": "Civic Capacity Erosion",
      "description": "People who want to understand and participate in civic life face growing barriers to doing so: they lack the time, attention, and confidence needed to evaluate information and engage meaningfully. As these capacities weaken, participation becomes less consistent and trust in public processes declines.",
