      "tier": 3,
      "title": "Uneven Civic Readiness",
      "description": "People who want to understand and participate in public life face unequal access to the knowledge, literacy, time, and confidence needed to interpret issues and engage effectively. As these capacities become unevenly distributed, civic conversations and participation become shaped by those with greater resources to make sense of complexity.\n",
